# AuroraSense Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to `apps/web/.env.local` to enable cloud backend and Meta AI coordinator features.
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY RULES:
# 1. NEVER commit your actual `apps/web/.env.local` or any secrets to Git.
# 2. Never prefix private secrets (META_MODEL_API_KEY, SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY) with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# 3. All external model API calls and database admin operations run server-side only in Next.js routes.

# ==============================================================================
# 1. Meta Model API (Muse Spark 1.3 Coordinator)
# ==============================================================================
# Required for: Stage-One Meta model integration & live coordinator route (`/api/agent`).
# Where to obtain: Meta Developer Portal (https://dev.meta.ai/) or Cerebral Valley event resources.
# Expected format: A Bearer token string (e.g., `meta_live_...` or hex/base64 token, typically 40-120 characters).
# Note: Verified model identifier is `muse-spark-1.3` using the Responses API endpoint:
# https://api.meta.ai/v1/responses
META_MODEL_API_KEY=your-meta-model-api-key-here

# ==============================================================================
# 2. Supabase Configuration (Managed Persistence & Auth)
# ==============================================================================
# Required for: Authenticated participant consent, durable budget reservations, and journal persistence.
# Where to obtain: Supabase Dashboard (https://supabase.com/dashboard) -> Project Settings -> API.

# Project URL: Must be https and end with .supabase.co
# Example: https://abcdefghijklmnopqrst.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co

# Public / Anon Key: Client-safe key for Supabase Auth and RLS-protected queries.
# Example: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZS...
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-supabase-publishable-anon-key

# Secret / Service Role Key: SERVER-ONLY key used by Next.js API routes (`/api/agent`).
# Must NEVER be exposed to the browser or prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Example: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZS...
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-secret-key

# ==============================================================================
# 3. Operational Notes
# ==============================================================================
# - Local demo mode: Without these variables, the web application runs entirely offline
#   using verified historical NASA CCMC, NOAA, and USGS Boulder fixtures, deterministic
#   local QC, and a clearly labeled scripted policy demo.
# - Budget protection: Server-side budget ledger limits primary Spark orchestration to $45 total,
#   $5/day, and max 1,000 calls.
